{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08533","headline":"送崔氏昆季之金陵 · 李白","name":"送崔氏昆季之金陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放歌倚东楼，行子期晓发。\n秋风渡江来，吹落山上月。\n主人出美酒，灭烛延清光。\n二崔向金陵，安得不尽觞。\n水客弄归櫂，云帆卷轻霜。\n扁舟敬亭下，五两先飘扬。\n峡石入水花，碧流日更长。\n思君无岁月，西笑阻河梁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}